  ['overlay', 'Overlay', 'An .xcconfig file that xcblame writes under .xcblame/ and adds to the build, so a setting changes without editing your project. Delete the file to undo.'],
  ['shadowed', 'Shadowed', 'The setting is also set at a higher level (target or project) that wins over the overlay, so the overlay alone cannot change it.'],
  ['provenance', 'Where this value is set', 'The level that sets a build setting: target settings, project settings, an .xcconfig file, or the default.'],
