  ['cause-class', 'Cause class', 'Why a task ran again in an incremental build: inputChanged (a file changed), scriptPhase (a script without declared outputs runs every time), settingsChanged (flags changed), upstreamInterface (a dependency\'s module interface changed), timestampChurn (a file was touched but its content is the same), planning (Xcode planned again), firstBuild (no earlier result), forced (Xcode forced it), driverRemark (only the Swift driver says why), unknown (no evidence).'],
