      el('p', { class: 'footnote' }, 'To get hotspots: run ', code('xcblame build --deep -- -scheme <YourScheme> -configuration Debug'),
        ' in the project folder (it builds once with the compiler\'s timing flags), or add ', el('code', { text: '-Xfrontend -debug-time-function-bodies' }), ' to Build Settings › Other Swift Flags for one build and analyze its log.'));
